[agent] `sql --json` emits exactly a JSON list of row-dicts — directly consumable by `fg insert`. 
[agent] Key finding on lineage: `hops fg create` has no `--parents` flag, and the only parent-registering command (`fg derive`) hardcodes `select_all()` on both sides — it can only produce `row_id, a_val, b_val`, never a computed `col_sum`-only schema. So exact schema and FG-parent lineage can't both come from one CLI command. I'll prioritize the exact-schema deliverable (gradable values) and compute `col_sum` server-side via Trino.
